# Large reference/vendored data — not source, tracked outside git for now.
# See MarkDownFiles/PLAN.md for the rationale (this repo was init'd purely to
# make src/ cleanup reversible, not to version large binary/reference data).
DATASET/
PyChemkin-master/
MECHANISM/
outputs/
xml_output/

# Caches / generated
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.codegraph/
.rmip_cantera_cache/
docs/_build/

# Dedicated venvs (bridged via subprocess, never imported directly — see
# feedback_env_isolation memory doc)
.venv-gui/

# Transient runtime / session state
project.db-shm
project.db-wal
.rmip_gui_autosave.json

# Phase 4 pause/resume: git-worktree checkouts for "pause a run, edit the
# source, resume with the change" (mso_workbench.git_pause). Each is a
# second working directory checked out onto its own mso-pause/* branch --
# the branch itself is real repo history, only the checkout is disposable.
.mso_pause_worktrees/
tmp*_target.opt

# Session/campaign test-run output and GUI runtime state — not source. The
# few reviewable artifacts worth keeping long-term get promoted into git
# elsewhere (e.g. bug.md write-ups, src/rmip/tests/fixtures/) rather than
# committing the whole directory. See bug.md 2026-08-04 note.
Test_run_23_JULY/
.gui_settings/
SIM_RUNS/*/

# MUQ-SAC / Sensitivity_Analysis pipeline scratch output — these scripts
# (src/MUQ-SAC/run_script.py, src/Sensitivity_Analysis/sens*.py, and ~20
# siblings) write directly to CWD-relative paths by long-standing design;
# running any of them from the repo root regenerates these. Not source,
# not meant to be committed (see MarkDownFiles/AMMONIA_CAMPAIGN_2026-07-22.md
# Phase 6 for an example run that produced them).
DM_FOR_PARTIAL_PRS/
YAML_FILES_FOR_PARTIAL_PRS/
sa_pipeline_v2_out/
Plots_SA/
ACTIVE_RXN_INDEX.csv
ACTIVE_RXN_LIST.csv
RXN_DICT.pkl
Reaction_dict.txt
Reaction_type.txt
selected_rxn.txt
sens_parameters.pkl
target_data.txt

# ReactionFamilyKB._call()'s default work_dir for the RMG-backend subprocess
# bridge (rmg_{cmd}_request/response.json) — regenerated on every family-scan
# / generate_targeted call, not source.
rmg_gen/

# Machine-local Claude Code permissions — not shared config.
.claude/settings.local.json
